<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W trades on kerb at PLN 14.4.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W trades on kerb at PLN 14.4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three kerb transactions in Mostostal-Warszawa in two packages of 30,000 and one in 35,000 at 14.4 zlotys per share were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Mostostal-Warszawa was traded at 14.8 zlotys in 19,038 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
